guide forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame
title Shard of the Green Flame
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 50-56
zone Felwood
keywords Niby the Almighty, What Niby Commands, Flawless Fel Essence, Kroshius' Infernal Core, Kroshius, Fel Fire, Impsy, Shard of the Green Flame, Jaedenar, Legashi, Felguard Sentry, Shatter Scar Vale, Warlock, class quest
reward item 18762
why A rare off-hand for your 50s from Niby and Impsy in Felwood, the camp that also offers An Imp's Request.

# Niby the Almighty's errands in Felwood: What Niby Commands (7601) to Impsy,
# Flawless Fel Essence (7602: Azshara, Jaedenar and the Dark Portal) and
# Kroshius' Infernal Core (7603), for the Shard of the Green Flame.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0
# and Questie-Forever) for Niby, Impsy, the essences' droppers, Kroshius and
# his remains; the classic quest data (quest 7603)
# for lighting the Fel Fire at the remains to wake him; Forever's
# Warlock class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/):
# unchanged in Forever, Kroshius' Infernal Core rewards the Shard of the Green
# Flame.
# Kroshius is elite: grouping up is advised.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step Niby the Almighty
  tip At 50 Niby the Almighty and his imp Impsy wait in central Felwood, just east of Jaedenar.
  level 50
  accept 7601                         -- Niby the Almighty
  turnin 7601                         -- Impsy
  accept 7602

step Jaedenar
  tip The Jaedenar Legionnaires, a short way west of Niby, carry Jaedenar's essence.
  collect 18622 quest 7602.2          -- Flawless Fel Essence (Jaedenar)

step Azshara
  zone Azshara
  tip The Legashi satyrs of northern Azshara carry Azshara's essence.
  collect 18624 quest 7602.1          -- Flawless Fel Essence (Azshara)

step The Dark Portal
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The Felguard Sentries around the Dark Portal, in southern Blasted Lands, carry its essence.
  collect 18623 quest 7602.3          -- Flawless Fel Essence (Dark Portal)

step Impsy
  zone Felwood
  turnin 7602                         -- Impsy
  accept 7603

step Kroshius
  tip Kroshius' remains lie in Shatter Scar Vale, north of Niby. Use the Fel Fire beside them and kill the infernal when he wakes. Kroshius is elite: grouping up is advised.
  use 18626 @45.7,34.8                -- Fel Fire, at Kroshius' Remains
  kill 14467 quest 7603.1             -- Kroshius
  collect 18625 quest 7603.2          -- Kroshius' Infernal Core

step Back to Niby
  turnin 7603                         -- Niby the Almighty: Shard of the Green Flame
